ctive": 1, "name": "沙發"}, {"key": "table_chairs", "active": 1, "name": "桌椅"}, {"key": "balcony", "active": 1, "name": "陽台"}, {"key": "lift", "active": 0, "name": "電梯"}, {"key": "park", "active": 0, "name": "車位"}], "notice": [{"key": "leaseTime", "name": "最短一年"}, {"key": "pet", "name": "不可養寵物"}]}, "preference": {"title": "優選理由", "active": 0, "footnote": "", "data": []}, "remark": {"title": "屋況介紹", "key": "remark", "active": 1, "content": "<p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>蘆洲線/靜巷/&nbsp;精緻風格一房好居所&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>溫馨極品築套房&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;高級設備貼心到位&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>1.&nbsp;空間:&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>室內享有10坪空間&nbsp;/&nbsp;磚牆隔間&nbsp;/&nbsp;一房一廳一衛&nbsp;/&nbsp;通風舒適&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>可煮食不怕半夜餓肚子.!&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>2.&nbsp;冷氣:&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>室內獨立冷氣&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;夏天絕對夠冷！&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>3.&nbsp;設備:&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>浴室電熱水器&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;不會冬天洗到一半沒熱水！&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>4.&nbsp;公共區:&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>監控系統.保護你我安全!&nbsp;飲水機環保新概念<br><br>5.&nbsp;排水排風:&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>全室排水孔&nbsp;&nbsp;皆使用特殊防蟲蓋&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;杜絕水管臭味&nbsp;&nbsp;杜絕蟑螂蚊蟲入侵&nbsp;!&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>6.&nbsp;安全監控:&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>全程監視器錄影&nbsp;&nbsp;以防不備之需<br><br>入住條件:&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>1.作息正常,無不良嗜好.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(吃檳榔.酗酒.作息顛倒者勿擾)&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>2.工作穩定,按時繳租.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>3.品行優,好相處.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>4.需年滿20歲以上.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>5.限本國國籍者.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>房東誠意出租~無誠勿擾<br></strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>租屋須附上:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>1.身份證正本+身分證影本x1&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>2.工作在職名片證明x1&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>3.保證人身分證影本x1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;保證人到場陪同簽訂租屋合約&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>隨時歡迎各位賞屋~&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>看屋請洽:&nbsp;房東指定代理人&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;陳先生&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;0901-315800&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>青成租屋</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>（107）新北經字第003546號&nbsp;&nbsp;不動產經紀人&nbsp;林忠諺</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>（111）登字第424430號&nbsp;不動產營業員&nbsp;陳禹丞</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>&nbsp;請各位提前預約看屋!&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>若無人接聽電話,請以簡訊方式留言,稍後將會回電給各位~<br><br>請勿直接在線上預約看屋,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>請勿直接在線上預約看屋,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>請勿直接在線上預約看屋,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>以防回覆時間已晚,而造成各位的不便,謝謝~</strong></span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近蘆洲公車站、三民高中捷運站、徐匯捷運站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "蘆洲區成功路", "lat": "25.0808639", "lng": "121.472897", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "中山一路站", "distance": 60, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約60公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "蘆洲監理站", "distance": 103, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約103公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "蘆洲派出所站", "distance": 115, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約115公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "翰坊早餐吧", "distance": 25, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約25公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "鈺昇珠寶銀樓", "distance": 96, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約96公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市蘆洲區蘆洲國民小學", "distance": 486, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約486公尺"}, {"type": "university", "name": "蘆荻社區大學", "distance": 507, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約507公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "12,500元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "服務費", "value": "收取服務費", "key": "serviceFee"}